Canadian investors may find valuation resets in retail as Eritzia lifts guidance after strong Q2 sales and tariff refunds. This is Modern Investing Techniques, Episode 197. Quick reminder, everything we discuss here is for education and entertainment. The practice investment of the day uses simulated trades with no real money. I'm not a licensed financial advisor and this isn't financial advice. Always do your own research before putting real money to work. The S&amp;P 500 closed at

