00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:04.360
The fair value estimate sits at $185.21 Canadian dollars.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:09.640
Risk comes from US expansion and marketing spend that could pressure margins if new stores

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:10.360
