00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:15.920
The invalidation level is a fair value estimate that falls below the current price on an updated

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:19.380
model or a Q3 guidance miss versus consensus.

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:26.260
The target is a positive 3-7% move over the five-session window if the valuation gap narrows.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:31.620
Confidence is medium because the earnings catalyst and cash flow support are strong, yet

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.180
