00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:38.280
This trade demonstrates how to read a fair value gap against recent price action and

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.380
balance sheet strength.

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:44.560
Listeners learn to cross-check narrative optimism with the actual discount to model value

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:45.720
before committing capital.

